;; Account declarations and opening positions that sample_plata.json's output
;; assumes. Prepended to the converter's output in plata_beancount_test.rb so a
;; real Beancount parser can check the generated ledger end to end.
;;
;; Commodity accounts use FIFO because the converter emits `{}` reductions, which
;; are ambiguous under the default STRICT booking once a ticker has two lots.
;;
;; Only positions held BEFORE the period are opened here. AMZN (transferred in),
;; MBGL (spun off) and TEMP (bought and sold within the month) appear during the
;; period, so the converter opens them itself — declaring them here as well would
;; be a duplicate open, which is exactly the collision to watch for when moving
;; these declarations out of a hand-maintained account_opens file.

option "operating_currency" "USD"

2025-10-31 open Assets:Investments:Plata:Cash    USD
2025-10-31 open Assets:Investments:Plata:AAPL    AAPL    "FIFO"
2025-10-31 open Assets:Investments:Plata:BND     BND     "FIFO"
2025-10-31 open Assets:Investments:Plata:EDV     EDV     "FIFO"
2025-10-31 open Assets:Investments:Plata:NFLX    NFLX    "FIFO"
2025-10-31 open Assets:Investments:Plata:NOPRICE NOPRICE "FIFO"
2025-10-31 open Assets:Investments:Plata:SPGI    SPGI    "FIFO"
2025-10-31 open Assets:Investments:Plata:VGK     VGK     "FIFO"
2025-10-31 open Income:Dividends:Plata USD
2025-10-31 open Income:Interest USD
2025-10-31 open Income:Gains:Plata USD
2025-10-31 open Expenses:Fees:Plata USD
2025-10-31 open Expenses:Taxes:Withholding:USA USD
2025-10-31 open Expenses:FIXME
2025-10-31 open Equity:Opening-Balances
2025-10-31 open Equity:FIXME

2025-10-31 * "Apertura" "posiciones previas al periodo"
  Assets:Investments:Plata:Cash     813.96 USD
  Assets:Investments:Plata:AAPL        14 AAPL    {157.81 USD}
  Assets:Investments:Plata:BND         16 BND     {73.30 USD}
  Assets:Investments:Plata:EDV         27 EDV     {86.68 USD}
  Assets:Investments:Plata:NFLX         5 NFLX    {480.46 USD}
  Assets:Investments:Plata:NOPRICE     10 NOPRICE {1.00 USD}
  Assets:Investments:Plata:SPGI         5 SPGI    {342.04 USD}
  Assets:Investments:Plata:VGK          5 VGK     {80.14 USD}
  Equity:Opening-Balances
